===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yi|en}} {{term|שיקסע|tr=shikse|lang=yi}}, which is partly derived from the {{etyl|he|en}} {{term|שֶׁקֶץ||abomination, impure, object of loathing|tr=shékets|lang=he}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃɪksə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|Judaism|derogatory|lang=en}} A non-Jewish [[girl]], especially one who is attractive and young
# A [[maiden]].

